```

| 属性 | 必填 | 类型 | 说明 |
|---|---|---|---|
| `color` | 否 | `AccentColor \| undefined` | Overrides the surrounding accent. Omit to follow the nearest data-accent, or the kit default. |
| `label` | 否 | `string \| undefined` |  |
| `suggestions` | 否 | `string[] \| undefined` |  |
